The MIB modules in internal/mib/mibs are copied unchanged from net-snmp
5.9.5.2 (https://www.net-snmp.org/, as packaged by nixpkgs in
share/snmp/mibs), leaving out its NET-SNMP-* and UCD-* modules. They are the
IETF and IANA MIB modules from the RFCs and IANA registries and keep their own
copyright notices. net-snmp's COPYING is at internal/mib/mibs/COPYING.
